<title>USA: National TechTeam buys Compuflex.</title>
<headline>National TechTeam buys Compuflex.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Mich. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>National TechTeam Inc said Thursday it acquired the outstanding shares of the common stock of Compuflex Systems Inc in exchange for about 509,000 shares of TEAM common stock.</p>
<p>The company said the deal has an estimated value of $8.5 million in stock options and cash for Compuflex shareholders.</p>
<p>The company said the deal calls for it to buy a 98 percent controlling interest in Compuflex from its principal stockholders and to acquire the remaining Compuflex shares for cash.</p>
